## Summary
Seoul National University of Science and Technology and KBIOHealth have signed a research cooperation agreement focused on quantum technology and advanced bio-health. This partnership aims to advance collaborative research in these cutting-edge fields, potentially benefiting medical and technological innovations.

## Key Points
- Signing of a formal cooperation agreement between Seoul National University of Science and Technology and KBIOHealth.
- Focus on quantum technology research for potential applications in various domains.
- Emphasis on advanced bio-health initiatives to drive medical advancements.
- Collaboration expected to foster interdisciplinary research and innovation.


